      "trackName": "Block Puzzle Game for Watch",
      "description": "Turn spare moments into satisfying wins.\nblock puzzle for watch is a lightweight block puzzle made for Apple Watch: drag, place, and clear lines to build combos and chase your best score.\nPerfect for quick breaks—on a commute, in a queue, or while waiting for coffee—just raise your wrist and start a round. The rules are simple, but every move matters. Plan your placements, keep the board open, and enjoy the “one more game” feeling anytime, anywhere.\nFast to start. Easy to learn. Hard to put down.\nKey Features (Bullets)\nMade for Apple Watch: clean UI and smooth controls on a small screen\nQuick sessions: play in 1–3 minutes—great for short breaks\nSimple gameplay: drag & place blocks, clear rows/columns\nStrategy depth: smarter planning leads to higher scores\nRelaxing & satisfying: satisfying clears and combo moments\nOffline friendly: play without an internet connection",
